Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, I been, I been losin' sleep\N♪ 最近我总是辗转反侧 难以入眠 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreamin' about the things that we could be\N♪ 对我们曾有过的愿景 浮想联翩 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But, baby, I been, I been prayin' hard\N♪ 但亲爱的 我始终在虔诚祈祷 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Said, "No more countin' dollars, we'll be countin' stars"\N♪ 别再数钱 我们一起数星星 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be countin' stars\N♪ 我们一起数星星 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see this life like a swingin' vine\N♪ 生活就像一株跃动的藤蔓 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Swing my heart across the line\N♪ 携心跨越世俗界限 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In my face is flashin' signs\N♪ 在我脸上 划过迹象 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek it out and ye shall find\N♪ 遍寻之后 你能发现 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The old, but I'm not that old\N♪ 成熟 但不老态龙钟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Young, but I'm not that bold\N♪ 年轻 却未鲁莽 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't think the world is sold\N♪ 坚信这个世界美好如初 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On just doin' what we're told\N♪ 只是循规蹈矩地生活 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel somethin' so right doin' the wrong thing\N♪ 明知何为对 却行错误之事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I feel somethin' so wrong doin' the right thing\N♪ 明知何为错 却行正确之举 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't lie, couldn't lie, couldn't lie\N♪ 我欺骗过 伪装过 失真过 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that kills me makes me feel alive\N♪ 所有打击 皆让我感受生命的脉动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, I been, I been losin' sleep\N♪ 最近我总是辗转反侧 难以入眠 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreamin' about the things that we could be\N♪ 对我们曾有过的愿景 浮想联翩 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But, baby, I been, I been prayin' hard\N♪ 但亲爱的 我始终在虔诚祈祷 ♪
