Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Said, "No more countin' dollars, we'll be, we'll be countin' stars"\N♪ 别再数钱 我们一起数星星 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel your love, and I feel it burn\N♪ 我感觉到爱火在胸中熊起 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Down this river, every turn\N♪ 于河流的每个迂回处翻腾 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hope" is our four-letter word\N♪ 希望只是个四字单词 ♪
